{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Seek to negotiate third-country removal schemes & deport all foreign criminals",
        "additional_details": "The UK is under significant financial pressure with regards to housing, welfare support, the NHS, schooling and security costs for our country. We believe illegal immigration is fuelling these financial pressures and that it is now time we put UK residents and taxpayers first. We want to ensure our children and grandchildren are protected, and that our island nation is protected too.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to seek to negotiate and establish more third-country removal schemes and to automatically deport all foreign nationals who are convicted of criminal offences and anyone whose claim has been refused, without delay.",
